msgctxt "%1 is the language code"
msgid ""
"The translation files for the language with the code '%2' could not be "
"found. The language has been removed from your configuration. If you want to "
"add it back, please install the localization files for it and add the "
"language again."
msgid_plural ""
"The translation files for the languages with the codes '%2' could not be "
"found. These languages have been removed from your configuration. If you "
"want to add them back, please install the localization files for it and the "
"languages again."
msgstr[0] ""
"De Översettendateien för de Spraak mit den Kode „%2“ laat sik nich finnen. "
"De Spraak wöör ut Dien instellen wegmaakt. Wullt Du ehr wedder tofögen, "
"installeer dor bitte de Översetten un anner Lokaliserendateien för un föög "
"ehr wedder to."
msgstr[1] ""
"De Översettendateien för de Spraken mit den Koden „%2“ laat sik nich finnen. "
"De Spraken wöörn ut Dien instellen wegmaakt. Wullt Du ehr wedder tofögen, "
"installeer dor bitte de Översetten un anner Lokaliserendateien för un föög "
"ehr wedder to."

#: kcmtranslations.cpp:147
msgid "Your changes will take effect the next time you log in."
msgstr "Dien Ännern warrt bi de nakamen Anmellen bruukt."

#: kcmtranslations.cpp:148
msgid "Applying Language Settings"
msgstr "Spraakinstellen warrt anwendt"

#: kcmtranslations.cpp:188
msgid ""
"<h1>Translations</h1>\n"
"<p>Here you can set your preferred language for translating the user "
"interface of your applications. You can choose a single language, or a list "
"of languages to be applied in sequence. Only language translations that are "
"installed on your system will be listed as available. If your language is "
"not listed then you will need to install it first.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h1>Översetten</h1>\n"
"<p>Hier kannst Du de Spraak instellen, in de Du de Böversiet vun Programmen "
"hebben wullt. Du kannst en enkelte Spraak utsöken oder en Reeg vun Spraken, "
"de in disse Reeg bruukt warrt. Bloots Översetten, de op Dien Systeem "
"installeert sünd, warrt as verföögbor wiest. Is Dien Spraak nich oplist, "
"muttst Du ehr toeerst installeren.</p>"

#: kcmtranslations.cpp:209
msgid "Available Languages:"
msgstr "Verföögbor Spraken:"

#: kcmtranslations.cpp:210
msgid ""
"This is the list of installed KDE Plasma language translations not currently "
"being used. <br />To use a language translation move it to the 'Preferred "
"Languages' list in the order of preference.  <br />If no suitable languages "
"are listed, then you may need to install more language packages using your "
"usual installation method."
msgstr ""
"Dit is de List vun installeert KDE-Plasma-Översetten, de Du opstunns nich "
"bruukst. <br />Wullt Du en Översetten bruken, verschuuv ehr na de "
"„Vörtrocken Spraken“ un legg ehr Reeg fast. <br />Is keen passen Spraak "
"oplist, muttst Du villicht mit Dien normaal Installeerwarktüüch noch anner "
"Spraakpaketen installeren."

#: kcmtranslations.cpp:219
msgid "Preferred Languages:"
msgstr "Vörtrocken Spraken:"

#: kcmtranslations.cpp:220
msgid ""
"This is the list of installed KDE Plasma language translations currently "
"being used, listed in order of preference.  <br />If a translation is not "
"available for the first language in the list, the next language will be "
"used. <br /> If no other translations are available then US English will be "
"used."
msgstr ""
"Dit is de List vun installeert KDE-Plasma-Översetten, de Du opstunns "
"bruukst, sorteert na Dien Möög. <br />Is en Översetten för de eerste Spraak "
"op de List nich verföögbor, warrt dat bi de nakamen Spraak versöcht. <br /"
">Is keen Spraak verföögbor, warrt US-Engelsch bruukt."

